<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission confirms green rate changes.</title>
<headline>EU Commission confirms green rate changes.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission on Tuesday confirmed that four green rates will be devalued from Wednesday.</p>
<p>The new rates are: One Ecu equals 40.0486 Belgian francs (old rate 39.9502), 1.94386 German marks (1.93805), 2.18167 Dutch guilders (2.17413), and 13.6782 Austrian schillings (13.6364).</p>
</text>
